        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000018-adf2a04fd7ef1568",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "After signing the unified term on April 11, 2025, we began offering, under the authorization regime, fixed-line telephone pay TV, mobile voice and broadband services throughout Brazil.",
        "start_character": 117440,
        "end_character": 117624
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000018-adf2a04fd7ef1568",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a commitment, we are required to provide infrastructure and service operating in any frequency band in rural areas in the states of Alagoas, Ceará, Minas Gerais, Paraíba, Pernambuco, Piauí, Rio Grande do Norte, Sergipe, and countryside of São Paulo, for a total of 2,556 municipalities.",
        "start_character": 173548,
        "end_character": 173837
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000018-adf2a04fd7ef1568",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a telecommunication service provider, we do not manufacture equipment for the construction of our networks and facilities.",
        "start_character": 77040,
        "end_character": 77165
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000018-adf2a04fd7ef1568",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our wholesale services, we provide interconnection services to other network providers.",
        "start_character": 77676,
        "end_character": 77774
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000018-adf2a04fd7ef1568",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Business Overview—Rates, Taxes and Billing—Interconnection fees.” We believe that we have adequate interconnection agreements with fixed-line and mobile operators necessary to provide our services and that we have all the necessary interconnection agreements with long-distance carriers.",
        "start_character": 141440,
        "end_character": 141727
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000018-adf2a04fd7ef1568",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Expanding our credit portfolio, we launched products designed to diversify risk and address high-demand business:",
