        "end_character": 81963
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002070979-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002070979-26-000018-adf2a04fd7ef1568",
        "accession_number": "0002070979-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Finally, we have a solid Carrier Grade Nat solution (CGNAT) already developed for the mobile services, which will be extended to fixed-line services along the next years as an additional solution.",
